Package: CoPRes
Type: Package
Title: Common, Proper and Residual Components (CoPRes) and Labelled Orthogonal Decomposition (LODE)
Version: 0.6.0
Date: 2026-11-11
Authors@R: person("Mohamed", "Hanafi", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "mohamed.hanafi@oniris-nantes.fr")
Description: Labelled orthogonal decomposition (LODE) of a space by several positive semi-definite
    matrices: common, proper and residual subspaces, Ky Fan bound, ideal labelling, and the LODE
    algorithm (target rotation TARO and labelling-basis construction B2BL); CoPRes factorisation of
    multiblock methods (CPCA, ACOM, ACCPS) with permutation thresholds, direct reading, mixing and
    dilution sheet, equivalence and sensitivity. Multigroup layer: covariance labelling,
    permutation thresholds within groups, common principal components, discrimination; bootstrap stability of the labelling;
    graphics in French or English (ggplot2). Results match the Python version through a shared Park-Miller generator.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: stats, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
